# BE quality gates

Must pass before merge (when applicable):

- `pnpm --filter api lint`
- `pnpm --filter api test`
- `pnpm --filter api build` (module/bootstrap changes)
- `pnpm --filter @repo/api build` (contract changes)
- `pnpm --filter api test:e2e` (HTTP flows, optional)

Commands policy: [agents/_shared/COMMAND_POLICY.md](../agents/_shared/COMMAND_POLICY.md)  
Detail: [docs/09-monorepo-and-commands.md](../docs/09-monorepo-and-commands.md)

After changes: **quality-gates** agent → **reviewer** last ([agents/coordinator/AGENTS.md](../agents/coordinator/AGENTS.md)).
